====Usage notes====
According to Oahpa, the nominative indefinite plural of this term is {{m|mdf|ведть}}, indefinite elative — {{m|mdf|ведьста}} and abessive — {{m|mdf|ведьфтома}}.<ref>{{R:mdf:O}}</ref>

However, according to Poljakov its plural is {{m|mdf|ветть}}.<ref>{{R:mdf:P}}</ref> The declension table above is based on the examples given by Poljakov.

